\begin_layout Subsubsection
ll_parlink_*
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The ll_parlink_*() group of functions are helper functions for writing a
 LocoLink server attached to a parallel port (including the 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

llparserv
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

